From 2bddc0bbe925c34624a9ae4732ddf0d979eef30e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 15:02:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] pinctrl: nexell: add S5P6818 pinctrl + GPIO driver

Pin controller and GPIO banks (A-E + ALIVE) for the Nexell S5P6818: ALTFN mux,
pull, drive-strength and GPIO in/out. Ported from the vendor BSP to the mainline
nexell pinctrl framework. Validated on hardware (RGMII pin mux for the GbE).

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
